This product bundles no third-party code. It runs on the Python standard
library and ships no vendored dependency, so there is nothing else here whose
copyright belongs to somebody else.

At run time it reads public archives that are not part of this work and carry
their own terms:

  lore.kernel.org        public mailing list archives
  patchwork.kernel.org   patch state, via its REST API
  git.kernel.org         whether a commit reached a tree

Patchvane only reads them. It posts nothing, and writes nothing back.
